<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<glyph name="ampersand" format="2">
  <advance width="719"/>
  <unicode hex="0026"/>
  <note>
Individually drawn ampersand; upper loop, diagonal ribbon and open crossing kept distinct.
Weight master: 正文细体：竖茎压到约 34，横画仍留 26，接合故意重于茎（48）以免尖脚断开。B 的上碗仍小于下碗，腰部反而松开；M 的谷抬高，避免细线收成针尖。e 的横画上移、开口加大。字距明显放松。
</note>
